# Grill-Me

## Workflow
When a task involves open-ended architecture, data migrations, or UI tradeoffs:
1. Identify all underspecified assumptions.
2. Ask targeted, multiple-choice or direct questions one decision at a time.
3. Record approved decisions directly in the implementation plan.
4. Never assume user intent on breaking changes or data contracts.

